#
# and enzyme transport is pore-gated. At a face between neighbouring cells,
#
#       D_E,f = De0 * max(phi_L, phi_R).
#
# Active enzyme is prescribed on all four exposed boundaries:
#
#       E = E_T on the boundary.
#
# NO KINETIC PARAMETER IS FITTED IN THIS SCRIPT.
# ================================================================


